{
  "description": "Curated vanilla member moves between Minecraft 1.20.1 and 1.21.1 that Mixin selectors and invokers follow. Every claim is checked against the real 1.21.1 and 1.20.1 game jars by scripts/mixin_target_facts.py verify.",
